{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 40,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3728637695312,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "monotherapy reduces the overall risk for TB by 33% (RR 0.67; 95% CI 0.51 ; 0.87) and that preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        79.31470489501953,
        527.4251708984375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(21) efficacy reached 64% for people with a positive TST (RR 0.36; 95% CI 0.22 ; 0.61)  . Furthermore,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4183349609375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "the efficacy of the 6-month regimen was not significantly different from that of 12 months of daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.522216796875,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid monotherapy (RR 0.58; 95% CI 0.3 ; 1.12). A systematic review of RCTs also showed a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.30224609375,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "significantly greater reduction in TB incidence among participants given the 6-month regimen than in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981584548950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        132.1147003173828,
        527.4912719726562,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "(80) those given a placebo (odds ratio [OR] 0.65; 95% CI 0.50 ; 0.83)  . No controlled clinical trials were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.997550010681152,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.401123046875,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "found of daily isoniazid monotherapy for 9 months (9H) versus 6H. Re-analysis and modelling of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.4302368164062,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "US Public Health Service trials of isoniazid conducted in the 1950s and 1960s, however, showed that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.3888549804688,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "the benefit of isoniazid increases progressively when it is given for up to 9–10 months and stabilizes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        184.9147491455078,
        527.4345703125,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "(81) thereafter  . For this reason, 9H is retained as an alternative regimen to 6H in the recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        127.72879028320312,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "TPT options.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09461975097656,
        527.1447143554688,
        235.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "Until the 2020 updated guidelines, daily IPT for 36 months was conditionally recommended for adults",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98288631439209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.2946319580078,
        527.4515991210938,
        248.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "and adolescents with HIV, regardless of whether they were receiving ART, in settings with a high risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.21864318847656,
        527.442626953125,
        261.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "(82) of TB transmission  . This recommendation was based on low-certainty evidence from a systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.4185791015625,
        527.4026489257812,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "(78) review and meta-analysis of three RCTs . In two of the studies reviewed, ART was not used, and,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.4384765625,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "in the third, ART coverage was low at baseline but increased during the period of observation. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.4376831054688,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "GDG for this second edition of the TPT guidelines decided to withdraw this recommendation given",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        527.1786499023438,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "its poor uptake by countries since its release in 2011. In the past decade, access to ART has increased",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994749069213867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        477.628173828125,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "substantially worldwide, and shorter TPT options are preferred to isoniazid monotherapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        338.3612976074219,
        405.14453125,
        356.6313171386719
      ],
      "text": "Weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid for 3 months (3HP)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.33721923828125,
        527.3177490234375,
        377.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review was conducted for the 2018 update of the guidelines to compare the effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961081504821777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.2611999511719,
        527.37353515625,
        390.980224609375
      ],
      "text": "(84–87) of 3HP with that of isoniazid monotherapy. The review was of four RCTs  , which were analysed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.99479866027832,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.7372131347656,
        527.608154296875,
        404.18023681640625
      ],
      "text": "for three subgroups: adults with HIV infection, adults without HIV infection and children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.93719482421875,
        527.4542846679688,
        417.3802185058594
      ],
      "text": "(2–17 years) who could not be stratified according to HIV status because the relevant studies were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.13720703125,
        527.4542236328125,
        430.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "lacking. The evidence base for this revised recommendation is summarized in the GRADE tables for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.33721923828125,
        117.16619873046875,
        443.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "PICO 8 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        117.17030334472656,
        429.33721923828125,
        163.06228637695312,
        443.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "annexes 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        163.06629943847656,
        429.33721923828125,
        183.55931091308594,
        443.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        186.57640075683594,
        429.33721923828125,
        192.24139404296875,
        443.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        192.24209594726562,
        429.33721923828125,
        194.68409729003906,
        443.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": ".",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        451.0411071777344,
        527.4301147460938,
        465.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "Two of the RCTs involved adults with HIV in Peru, South Africa and a number of countries with a TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        464.2411193847656,
        527.414794921875,
        478.68414306640625
      ],
      "text": "incidence < 100/100 000 population. No significant difference in the incidence of TB disease was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        477.4411315917969,
        527.4067993164062,
        491.8841552734375
      ],
      "text": "found between participants given 3HP and 6H or 9H (RR 0.73, 95% CI 0.23 ; 2.30). Furthermore, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        490.6411437988281,
        527.4328002929688,
        505.08416748046875
      ],
      "text": "risk for hepatotoxicity was significantly lower with 3HP in both adults with HIV (RR 0.26, 95% CI 0.12 ;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        503.84124755859375,
        527.4247436523438,
        518.2842407226562
      ],
      "text": "0.55) and those without HIV (RR 0.16, 95% CI 0.10 ; 0.27). The 3HP regimen was also associated with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.0411376953125,
        527.5353393554688,
        531.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "a higher completion rate in all subgroups (adults with HIV: RR 1.25, 95% CI 1.01 ; 1.55; adults without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999149322509766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.2410888671875,
        527.3851318359375,
        544.68408203125
      ],
      "text": "HIV: RR 1.19, 95% CI 1.16 ; 1.22; children and adolescents: RR 1.09, 95% CI 1.03 ; 1.15). One RCT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.1651000976562,
        527.4215698242188,
        557.8841552734375
      ],
      "text": "(84) .  included a comparison between 3HP and continuous isoniazid monotherapy in adults with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.64111328125,
        524.416259765625,
        571.0841064453125
      ],
      "text": "No significant difference in TB incidence was found in an intention-to-treat analysis; however, a per-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.8411865234375,
        527.5457153320312,
        584.2841796875
      ],
      "text": "protocol analysis showed a lower rate of TBI or death among participants given continuous isoniazid.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99069595336914,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.0411376953125,
        338.7601318359375,
        597.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "In all the studies, 3HP was given under direct observation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        607.90771484375,
        385.6607971191406,
        626.1776733398438
      ],
      "text": "Daily rifampicin plus isoniazid for 3 months (3HR)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.8837280273438,
        527.4334716796875,
        647.3267211914062
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review updated in 2017 showed that the efficacy and the safety profile of 3–4 months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.8077392578125,
        527.4212036132812,
        660.5267333984375
      ],
      "text": "(80,88) of daily rifampicin plus isoniazid were similar to those of 6 months of isoniazid  . A previous",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.2835693359375,
        527.6074829101562,
        673.7265625
      ],
      "text": "GDG therefore strongly recommended that daily rifampicin plus isoniazid be used as an alternative to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984739303588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.2076416015625,
        527.4302368164062,
        686.9266357421875
      ],
      "text": "(37) isoniazid in settings with a TB incidence < 100/100 000 population  . A review of studies in which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.68359375,
        527.446533203125,
        700.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "the effectiveness of rifampicin plus isoniazid daily for 3 months was compared with that of isoniazid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.6077270507812,
        527.4177856445312,
        713.3267211914062
      ],
      "text": "(89–91) for 6 or 9 months in children comprised one RCT and two observational studies . (See also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.0836791992188,
        269.286865234375,
        726.5266723632812
      ],
      "text": "GRADE evidence summaries for PICO 5 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        269.9067077636719,
        712.0836791992188,
        316.42584228515625,
        726.5266723632812
      ],
      "text": "annexes 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        316.4241027832031,
        712.0836791992188,
        340.5516357421875,
        726.5266723632812
      ],
      "text": "and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        341.1759948730469,
        712.0836791992188,
        346.84100341796875,
        726.5266723632812
      ],
      "text": "4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        346.8424987792969,
        712.0836791992188,
        527.4413452148438,
        726.5266723632812
      ],
      "text": ".) The RCT found no clinical disease in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.2836303710938,
        527.4495849609375,
        739.7266235351562
      ],
      "text": "either group when new radiographic findings suggestive of TB disease were used as a proxy for clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966299057006836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        737.2075805664062,
        527.3944091796875,
        752.9265747070312
      ],
      "text": "(90) disease  . Fewer participants given daily rifampicin plus isoniazid than those given 9 months of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        751.68359375,
        527.43408203125,
        766.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid developed radiographic changes (RR 0.49, 95% CI 0.32 ; 0.76). The authors also reported a",
